Package: ReRAR
Type: Package
Title: Revision-Aware Response-Adaptive Randomization
Version: 1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("ReRAR", "Development Team", role = "aut"),
    person("haohao", role = "cre",
           email = "224397039+haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com")
  )
Author: ReRAR Development Team [aut]
Maintainer: haohao <224397039+haohaostats@users.noreply.github.com>
URL: https://github.com/haohaostats/ReRAR
BugReports: https://github.com/haohaostats/ReRAR/issues
Description: Implements revision-aware response-adaptive randomization for
    two-arm trials with an early provisional binary outcome and a delayed
    final binary outcome. The package estimates treatment-specific outcome
    revision, maps directional evidence to a bounded allocation target,
    tracks that target with a doubly adaptive biased-coin design, and provides
    a final contrast-stabilized augmented inverse-probability weighted
    analysis using stored randomization probabilities.
